    affiliation: "Université de Poitiers"
version: 0.1.0.dev0
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/AnywidgetInstruments/anywidget-instruments-automotive"
url: "https://anywidgetinstruments.github.io/anywidget-instruments-automotive/"
abstract: >-
  Speedometer, tachometer, fuel and temperature gauges, tell-tales, trip
  computer, odometer, gear indicator, the indicators of electric and hybrid
  drivetrains, and an instrument cluster with a head-up display mode, for
  Jupyter, marimo and other anywidget hosts. A TypeScript front end computes
  everything a widget shows, units included, from traits described by a
  contract in JSON Schema, so that Python, Julia, Rust and web pages show
  the same figures. For visualization, teaching and simulation: not vehicle
  instruments.
keywords:
